<title>USA: Bay Pond holds 5.10 pct RedFed stake.</title>
<headline>Bay Pond holds 5.10 pct RedFed stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners L.P. said Tuesday it holds a 5.10 percent stake in RedFed Bancorp or 360,900 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said its latest transactions include the purchase of 360,500 common shares from August 13 to September 9 at prices ranging from $8.75 to $10.25 per share.</p>
<p>Bay Pond said it bought the shares for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
